  "title": "Add: shape equal count rejected",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Add: shape equal count rejected",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "Equal element counts do not make shapes[2,2] and[1,4] compatible. Native finite owned profile; original scalar IEEE slots and explicit private Simulation examples remain separate.\n\nEqual element counts do not make shapes[2,2] and[1,4] compatible. Native finite owned profile; original scalar IEEE slots and explicit private Simulation examples remain separate.\n\nMode: expected-diagnostic. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.numeric.aggregate-left-fold@1; finite owned numeric promotion.\nExpected:\nDiagnostic: native.numeric.incompatible_shape",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
